WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.936
We hope you're doing
well tonight.

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.971
Now, if you don't mind, we're
going to get to the news.

00:00:05.971 --> 00:00:08.207
White House officials
are reportedly planning

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:12.111
to downplay President Biden's
upcoming 80th birthday.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:15.181
Well, good luck with that,
'cause everything about Biden

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:18.251
screams "birthday week."

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:20.819
"Monday, I'm going bowling
with my college buds.

00:00:20.819 --> 00:00:22.055
Tuesday, shots.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.823
Wednesday's Dave &amp; Busters,

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.592
then we're all flying to Ibiza."

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:27.994
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:30.029
President Biden's granddaughter
Naomi is set to get married

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:32.999
next month at the White House,
though if you're trying to make

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.667
people to forget how
old you are,

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:37.203
maybe don't advertise
that your granddaughter

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.538
is getting married.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.106
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:43.142
According to a newly-obtained
audio, house minority leader

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:45.378
Kevin McCarthy told two
police officers

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:47.780
in a private meeting that former
President Trump

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.782
didn't know that his supporters

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:52.085
were attacking the Capitol
on January 6th.

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:56.255
And the only possible way I'd
believe that is if he didn't

00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:58.124
know this was the Capitol.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.559
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.461
[ As Trump ] "I thought it was
a Medieval Times.

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:05.431
I thought it was
a Medieval Times."

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:07.934
[ Normal voice ] Election day
is four weeks away.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:10.469
Said Biden, "Uh, well, then
we're also giving everyone

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.005
in jail for a weed 40 bucks."

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:14.107
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.642
Elon Musk discussed his
estranged daughter

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:19.946
in a new interview and added,
"I have very good relationships

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.247
with all of the others.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.681
Can't win them all."

00:01:22.681 --> 00:01:25.651
Hell, some people
can't even count them all.

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:29.255
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.591
The Northeastern University
School of Law mistakenly sent

00:01:32.591 --> 00:01:35.695
acceptance e-mails recently
to nearly 4,000 applicants.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:38.464
Even worse, Harvard Law
accidentally sent

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:42.135
an acceptance e-mail to someone
whose dad didn't even go there.

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.070
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:48.741
And finally, according to a new
ranking of fast food chains,

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:51.143
Chick-fil-A has the slowest
average drive-through

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.846
experience, while the fastest
drive-through experience

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:56.582
is McDonald's when all you
order is ice cream.

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:58.650
"Yeah, one ice cream cone
please?"

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:00.053
"Sorry, it's broken."

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:01.187
"Bye!"

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.555
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:03.957
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

